---
title: Shortcrust
cooklang: 2
yield: 500%g
makes: enough for one 23 cm tart with trimmings
unit system: metric
tags: [base, pastry]
---

`Rub` @cold butter{125%g}(cubed) into @plain flour{250%g} and @fine salt{=1%pinch} with
your fingertips until ~{it looks like coarse sand}.

`Bring together ×` with @ice water{3-4%tbsp}, a spoon at a time, until ~{it just holds}.
Do not knead. -> dough

`Rest` the @&dough{} wrapped in the #fridge{} for ~rest{1%hour} before rolling.
